; PlayQuake640 -- PlayQuake (sound, LAN, the fastest RadeonGL settings) at
; 640 x 480. Needs a Picasso96 mode of 640 x 480 on the Radeon. In the GLQuake
; drawer beside PlayQuake; anything after the name goes to GLQuake too.
.KEY ARGS/F
.BRA {
.KET }
Execute PlayQuake -width 640 -height 480 {ARGS}
